  "takeaway": "Down 1–0 after one, Boston got goals from JJ Peterka and Pavel Zacha on the power play in the second and David Pastrnak's 10th in the third to beat Detroit 4–1, snapping a three-game skid. Jeremy Swayman made 20 saves.",
